        {
          "text": " Lo ŋes etiai loka iboro luka ewema lokalaunan, ŋes ewema lokalaunan loka aiteienunet, kwape aponi kimarere, kwape ajaar aicorakinet naka Musa, araun aiiaanakin naka Ilebin, kakan naka Itamar, okoku loka Aaron esasedoti. ",
